\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Qpo!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1dc60cee-a6ca-44c7-b505-fabc35d2000a.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Qpo!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1dc60cee-a6ca-44c7-b505-fabc35d2000a.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Qpo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1dc60cee-a6ca-44c7-b505-fabc35d2000a.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Qpo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1dc60cee-a6ca-44c7-b505-fabc35d2000a.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>And now…they started leaking data.   ALPHV is Blackcat, thus my title.  First, to Wired two days ago:</p><blockquote><p><em>WIRED </em><strong><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/change-healthcare-ransomhub-threat/\">received</a></strong>&nbsp;samples of Change Healthcare data allegedly stolen by RansomHub, and it appears to be legitimate. RansomHub claims to be holding four terabytes of stolen data and is demanding a ransom from Change Healthcare.&nbsp;</p></blockquote><p>And now they are reported to be posting both PHI and contracts between Change/UHC and counterparties.  The discovery in the subsequent legal matters is getting more streamlined, at least.</p><p>Yesterday, techcrunch shared:</p><blockquote><p>An extortion group has published a portion of what it says are the private and sensitive patient records on millions of Americans stolen during the ransomware attack on Change Healthcare in February.</p></blockquote><p><a href=\"https://www.beckershospitalreview.com/cybersecurity/hackers-leak-change-healthcare-contracts-patient-data.html\">And Becker’s added:</a></p><blockquote><p>\"The payment of a ransom doesn't guarantee the cybercriminal will decrypt a victim's files or reinstate access to their systems,\" Darren Guccione, co-founder and CEO of cybersecurity firm Keeper Security, emailed in a statement to <em>Becker's</em>. \"<em>They are criminals and, as such, they cannot be trusted.\"</em></p></blockquote><p>Thank God UnitedHealth Group is not under any investigation by the DOJ and can be trusted implicitly—you know, cause you can’t trust criminals to do what they say even after you pay them.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg\" width=\"800\" height=\"1422\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1422,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:512169,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OauI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52232e26-3991-49a7-ba78-df78f71eaa61_800x1422.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Oh, Wait.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/we-have-the-data-and-are-not-adorable?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/we-have-the-data-and-are-not-adorable?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>","text":"Ugh. So, ransom enthusiasts RansomHub have started the PHI leak bloodbath from Change Healthcare.\n\nSubscribe now\n\nThis is their initial lame ransom note.\n\nAnd now…they started leaking data. ALPHV is Blackcat, thus my title. First, to Wired two days ago:\n\nWIRED received samples of Change Healthcare data allegedly stolen by RansomHub, and it appears to be legitimate. RansomHub claims to be holding four terabytes of stolen data and is demanding a ransom from Change Healthcare.\n\nAnd now they are reported to be posting both PHI and contracts between Change/UHC and counterparties. The discovery in the subsequent legal matters is getting more streamlined, at least.\n\nYesterday, techcrunch shared:\n\nAn extortion group has published a portion of what it says are the private and sensitive patient records on millions of Americans stolen during the ransomware attack on Change Healthcare in February.\n\nAnd Becker’s added:\n\n\"The payment of a ransom doesn't guarantee the cybercriminal will decrypt a victim's files or reinstate access to their systems,\" Darren Guccione, co-founder and CEO of cybersecurity firm Keeper Security, emailed in a statement to Becker's . \" They are criminals and, as such, they cannot be trusted.\"\n\nThank God UnitedHealth Group is not under any investigation by the DOJ and can be trusted implicitly—you know, cause you can’t trust criminals to do what they say even after you pay them.\n\nOh, Wait.\n\nShare"}